            "action_name": {
              "value": "Bosun's Command"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, concentrate, emotion, linguistic, mental)\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe bosun orders an ally to attack or to get in position. Until the end of the ally's next turn, they gain the bosun's choice of a +2 status bonus to attack rolls or a +10-foot status bonus to their Speeds."
            },
